        "mapUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Egarosindur+historic+settlement%2C+Egarosindur%2C+Pakundia+Upazila%2C+Kishoreganj%2C+Kishoreganj%2C+Bangladesh"
