        "desc": "The Mawa viewpoint offers an awe-inspiring panorama of the monumental Padma Multipurpose Bridge, Bangladesh's greatest engineering feat spanning 6.15 kilometers. Visitors gather along dedicated riverfront promenades and viewing spots to witness the steel truss spans stretching endlessly across the horizon. The site offers incredible photo opportunities, especially when night illuminates the bridge pillars with dazzling architectural LED lighting reflections upon the water. River boat excursions departing from nearby piers allow guests to cruise closer to the colossal pillars and appreciate the staggering scale of the structure. It stands as a powerful symbol of national pride and modern infrastructure beauty.",
