        "name": "Enayetpur riverside area",
        "nameEn": "Enayetpur riverside area",
        "nameBn": "এনায়েতপুর নদীতীর ও তাঁতশিল্প পল্লী",
        "category": "Handloom Textile & Spiritual Waterfront",
